            "publisher": "국가유산청 (Korea Heritage Service) — 국가유산포털",
            "url": "https://www.heritage.go.kr/heri/cul/culSelectDetail.do?pageNo=1_1_1_0&ccbaKdcd=17&ccbaAsno=0001520000000&ccbaCtcd=ZZ&ccbaCpno=127ZZ01520000",
